    {
      "text": "对本题(1)所得通解 $x(t)=(At+B)e^{-t}$，求满足初值 $x(0)=2,x'(0)=-1$ 的特解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "初值问题",
        "常数确定"
      ],
      "question_type": "计算题",
      "method": [
        "代入初值求解线性方程组"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "由 $x(0)=B$ 求 $B$",
        "求导后代入 $x'(0)$ 求 $A$",
        "写出特解"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "ivp_repeated_root_ode",
        "template": "$x(t)=(At+B)e^{-t}$，$x(0)=2,x'(0)=-1$",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$x(0)=(A\\cdot0+B)e^0=B=2$。",
            "$x'(t)=Ae^{-t}-(At+B)e^{-t}=[A-(At+B)]e^{-t}$，故 $x'(0)=A-B=-1$，代入 $B=2$ 得 $A=-1+2=1$。",
            "特解：$x(t)=(t+2)e^{-t}$。验证 $x(0)=2$✓，$x'(t)=(1-(t+2))e^{-t}=(-1-t)e^{-t}$，$x'(0)=-1$✓。"
          ]
        }
      ],
