        "计算 $x_5$ 并用递推关系验证"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "ivp_repeated_root_recurrence",
        "template": "$x_n=(An+B)(-1)^n$，$x_0=3,x_1=-1$，求 $x_5$",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$x_0=B(-1)^0=B=3$。",
            "$x_1=(A+B)(-1)^1=-(A+B)=-1\\Rightarrow A+B=1\\Rightarrow A=1-3=-2$。故 $x_n=(-2n+3)(-1)^n=(3-2n)(-1)^n$。",
            "计算 $x_5=(3-10)(-1)^5=(-7)(-1)=7$。用递推验证：先算 $x_2=(3-4)(1)=-1$，$x_3=(3-6)(-1)=3$，$x_4=(3-8)(1)=-5$，$x_5=-2x_4-x_3=-2(-5)-3=10-3=7$，与公式结果一致，验证正确。"
          ]
        }
      ],
